1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
一只虾饺，十二道褶
One shrimp dumpling, twelve pleats

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
少捏一道，师傅都嫌丑
One less, and the master frowns

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
皮薄到，能看见里面的虾
So thin the shrimp shows through

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
秘密是"澄面"，小麦淀粉
The secret: wheat starch, not flour

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
一上锅蒸，就变透明水晶
Steamed, it turns to clear crystal

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
1920年代，广州五凤村
The 1920s, a Guangzhou village

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
河涌边的小茶楼发明了它
A riverside teahouse invented it

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
如今是早茶"四大天王"之首
Now the first of dim sum's Four Kings

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
一盅两件，广东人的清晨
"One pot, two baskets" — a Canton morning

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
咬开——满口弹牙的鲜虾
Bite in — a mouthful of springy shrimp

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
十二道褶，你数得清吗？
Twelve pleats — can you count them all?

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,600
下集：那顶橙红"黄帽子"
Next: the little orange-crowned hat
